        "comment": "No one seems to know exact details\r\nof these sessions anywhere, but the most thorough details available are shown based\r\non what was written on the PCM tapes and other sources.]\r\n\r\nThese recordings are of specific interest to completists, but marginal interest to the\r\ncasual listener.  To those of us who really missed the band during the year 1975 when\r\nthey went into isolation, these recordings give a rare glimpse into the studio where\r\nthey were working out the bugs developing tunes to be put on \"Blues for Allah\".",
